      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You stand in front of the Merchants\u2019 place, your backpack empty and
    your spirit down.  You do not enter the building.\r\nSlowly you walk to the inn
    and take place at your usual spot. Once more you see the adveturers together
    as a group and your heart burns for company.  Whilst peering off into the crowd
    one of the faces suddenly jumps out to you. It was the person you saved whilst
    in the dungeon. You lock eyes, and you sense\u2026 kinship.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
