  m_text: "You once more rest at the table in the corner of the inn. You can\u2019t
    eat, not only are you too nervous for this endeavor but the gigantic breast plate
    is also in front of your mouth.\r\nToo your dismay no one once more seems to
    care. grumbles, muffled by the enormous breastplate\r\n"
